B.cWt=new A.K("logic","Logic puzzle #992: a number times itself minus 82 equals 7314. What is the number?","86")
B.d1Z=new A.K("love","[Set 32] I have a heart that never beats yet lovers chase me across centuries. What am I?","A love letter")
B.cWE=new A.K("love","[Set 32] Two share me but neither owns me alone; without trust I vanish. What am I?","A secret")
B.d1v=new A.K("love","Deep riddle #963 \u2014 I grow when given away in romance yet shrink when hoarded in silence. What am I?","Affection")
B.cZA=new A.K("love","[Set 32] I bind no rope yet hold two souls tighter than chains. What am I?","A vow")
B.d_u=new A.K("love","Challenge 965: Seen in eyes before spoken on lips; I arrive first at every true meeting. What am I?","Recognition")
B.cTB=new A.K("bible","Deep riddle #966 \u2014 I swallowed a man yet could not digest his prayer; I returned him on the third dawn. What am I? (Think carefully.)","The great fish")
B.cPN=new A.K("bible","[Set 32] Built with pitch and gopher wood, I rode forty days of rain. What am I?","Noah's ark")
